      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "monitor if the Referee Reports have been completed. If they have been completed, you can proceed with the process. However, if they have not been completed, you should flag it and send a reminder."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the condition evaluation, XOR decision gateway, positive/negative outcome guards, and the fallback flag-and-reminder action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n5"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After that, you should check again if the Referee Reports have been completed. If they have, you can continue with the process. If not, you should flag it again and send another reminder.",
        "If not, you should flag it again and send another reminder."
      ],
      "justification": "Models the re-evaluation loop, second decision point, repeated reminder action, and the convergence point where parallel/retry flows rejoin."
    },
