        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Next, you need to check if a Psychometric Test is required. If it is, you should then check if an HR Specialist is required."
      ],
      "justification": "Accurately models the sequential conditional checks and their corresponding XOR gateways without dropping qualifiers."
    },
    {
