      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If not, you can continue with the process and coordinate the second round of selection. If an HR Specialist is required, you should schedule the test with a third party. Otherwise, you can proceed to complete the Psychometric Test."
      ],
      "justification": "Correctly branches based on test necessity and HR involvement, routing to coordination, third-party scheduling, or direct test completion, then converges back."
